@base = http://127.0.0.1:5200
@apiKey = REPLACE_LOCALLY_DO_NOT_COMMIT

### Public health
GET {{base}}/health

### Problem catalog, excludes hidden tests
GET {{base}}/api/problems
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### Reuse this key only for an identical retry
POST {{base}}/api/submissions
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Idempotency-Key: example-request-0001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "problem_id": "pair-sum",
  "language": "python",
  "source": "print(sum(map(int,input().split())))"
}

### Queue
GET {{base}}/api/submissions
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### Replay events from a known cursor
GET {{base}}/api/events?after=0
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
